I'll create a professional Angular-based solution for accessing WhatsApp status files on Android using Capacitor (since Angular web apps need a native bridge for file system access).
Step 1: Install Required Dependencies
bashnpm install @capacitor/core @capacitor/filesystem @capacitor/app
